'''Aislinn Connolly''' is a [[camogie]] player who was an [[Camogie All Stars Awards|All Star winner]] in [[Camogie All Stars Awards#2010|2010]] and [[Camogie All Stars Awards#2011|2011]] and a member of the [[All-Ireland Senior Camogie Championship 2011#Team of the championship|Team of the Championship]] for 2011. She played in the All Ireland finals of [[All-Ireland Senior Camogie Championship 2010|2010]]<ref>2010 All-Ireland Final reports in [http://www.irishexaminer.com/sport/wexford-jumping-for-joy-130651.html Irish Examiner], [http://www.independent.ie/sport/hurling/leacys-keep-it-in-family-as-wexford-take-the-title-2335205.html Irish Independent] and [http://www.independent.ie/sport/hurling/game-at-a-glance-2335203.html Irish Independent match at a glance], [http://www.irishtimes.com/newspaper/sport/2010/0913/1224278756702.html Irish Times colour piece] and [http://www.irishtimes.com/newspaper/sport/2010/0913/1224278758136.html match report], comment by [http://www.irishtimes.com/newspaper/sport/2010/0913/1224278759793.html Tom Humphries] and [http://www.irishtimes.com/newspaper/sport/2010/0913/1224278758058.html Mary Hannigan], [http://www.rte.ie/sport/gaa/championship/2010/0912/wexford_galway.html RTÉ online] {{webarchive|url=https://web.archive.org/web/20110830101326/http://www.rte.ie/sport/gaa/championship/2010/0912/wexford_galway.html |date=2011-08-30 }}, [http://www.irishtimes.com/sports/gaa/2010/0912/1224278753106.html Irish Times online] and [http://www.rte.ie/sport/gaa/championship/2010/0912/gaa_championship_12_september_live_text.html RTÉ online match-tracker] {{webarchive|url=https://web.archive.org/web/20101017155209/http://www.rte.ie/sport/gaa/championship/2010/0912/gaa_championship_12_september_live_text.html |date=2010-10-17 }}</ref> and [[All-Ireland Senior Camogie Championship 2011|2011]].<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.rte.ie/sport/gaa/championship/2011/0911/wexford_galway.html |title=Wexford 2-07 Galway 1-08 |date=11 September 2011 |work=RTÉ